{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05803","headline":"闻邻家理筝 · 徐安贞","name":"闻邻家理筝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北斗横天夜欲阑，愁人倚月思无端。\n忽闻画阁秦筝逸，知是邻家赵女弹。\n曲成虚忆青蛾敛，调急遥怜玉指寒。\n银锁重关听未辟，不如眠去梦中看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}